00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:55.460
And maybe in this particular painting,

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:57.240
maybe we'll have a tiny bit of water.

00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:58.780
So while I'm going here,

00:01:58.960 --> 00:01:59.980
just leave that color on.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.000
on the brush and I'll add a small amount of phthalo green.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.040
Let me repeat that, small amount.

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:09.400
It is so strong, it'll turn you

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.120
