00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:12.310
Let's go up here.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:14.600
Maybe the water will live right here.

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:17.060
So we'll just take and go across.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:21.800
And normally, if water is still, it's flat, it's level.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:24.640
So try to keep your strokes pretty straight.

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:27.270
You don't want your water to run off on the floor.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.760
Okay, isn't that easy?

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.220
